{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/01/16/7877750/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤リップ好き。\nいつもと違う自分になれる気がするの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子にとってメイクは\nとっても大事な、大切なものだよね◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この土日は京都の雪景色を沢山撮れて\n充実したカメラ日和にもなりました。\n沢山撮れたのでまた載せていきます◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#chihashot"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/01/16/7877750/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪道！\n関東は全然雪降ってなかったって\n母から聞いてたので\nこうして見返してみるとまだ不思議な感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗だけど積雪には気を付けないとね...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/01/16/7877750/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ち時間に少し外に出て\n雪を服に少し積もらせて\n必死に写真を撮った写真笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「みて！！( ¨̮ )」の気持ちが前面に。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/01/16/7877750/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤い服の上にほのかに乗っている\n白いのは雪だよ！笑\n少し溶けちゃった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ヒロイン」back numberさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はやっぱりこの曲かな◎\n京都で雪を見たときに\n真っ先に聴きたくなった。\n等身大な歌詞だからこそ\n心に残るし歌いたくなる。\n\"雪が綺麗と笑うのは君がいい\nでも寒いねって嬉しそうなのも\"\n名曲だな〜！\n切ない雰囲気も大好き。\n日常的を切り取った歌詞も\nより切なくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/01/16/7877750/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈の唇もすき♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もChihAnswer募集します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんぜひ\\( ˆ ˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}